# HogEye monthly cycle

For any monthly content, hub review, WordPress publish, SEO strategy/baseline push, or Schell/Casey/Lily status email:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/he-monthly-cycle/SKILL.md`
2. Use `docs/MONTHLY_PUBLISHING_WORKFLOW.md` as the operator playbook
3. Required path: hub status → pull/apply → WordPress draft → confirm URLs → Gmail draft. Do not skip CMS publish.
4. WordPress only (`docs/PUBLISH_SAFETY_MANDATE.md`); never Shopify commands against hogeyecameras.com
5. Hub slug is `hogeye-cameras` (not `hogeye`)
6. No em dashes in client-facing emails
7. Hub Approved ≠ live; never re-push content after `pull-approved --apply`
8. Writing new pieces follows `docs/WRITING_LOOP.md` (a copy of the canonical `WRITING_LOOP.md` in the Wildlife Dominion folder): approved reader sentence first, one piece at a time through `scripts/seo/draft_piece.py`, never a whole month in one sitting
